WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.024
"That woman was a demon!" cried Wukong.

2
00:00:05.025 --> 00:00:08.152
"And she kidnapped the Tang Monk!"

3
00:00:08.153 --> 00:00:12.807
He leaped into the air, and Bajie and Wujing followed.

4
00:00:12.808 --> 00:00:18.029
In the distance the monkey saw a dark cloud speeding toward a mountain.

5
00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:21.020
"That must be her," said Wukong.

6
00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:26.208
"Quickly!" said Wujing. "We must catch her!"

7
00:00:26.209 --> 00:00:31.688
They raced after the cloud, which disappeared when it reached the mountain.

8
00:00:31.689 --> 00:00:35.929
[g@They soon arrived at the mountain and found a cave.

9
00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:38.272
Its door was closed.@g]

10
00:00:38.273 --> 00:00:40.954
[g@Wukong pounded on the cave door.

11
00:00:40.955 --> 00:00:43.158
"Open up!" he yelled.@g]

12
00:00:43.159 --> 00:00:46.996
The door flew open, and the woman came out.

13
00:00:46.997 --> 00:00:49.869
[g@"Who are you?" demanded the woman.

14
00:00:49.870 --> 00:00:52.527
"Why are you pounding on my door?"@g]

15
00:00:52.528 --> 00:00:57.160
"Release our master!" shouted Wukong, ignoring her questions.

16
00:00:57.161 --> 00:00:59.780
[g@The woman laughed.

17
00:00:59.781 --> 00:01:05.169
"Don't tell me what to do!"@g]

18
00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:08.433
The monkey attacked.

19
00:01:08.434 --> 00:01:14.321
The woman spun around fast, blocking his iron bar and striking back with fury.

20
00:01:14.322 --> 00:01:17.777
"You shouldn't have come here!" she shouted as she fought.

21
00:01:17.778 --> 00:01:20.885
"Even Buddha is afraid of me!"

22
00:01:20.886 --> 00:01:25.063
Bajie tried to hit her with his rake but missed.

23
00:01:25.064 --> 00:01:28.715
The woman was now spinning faster and faster.

24
00:01:28.716 --> 00:01:32.157
"She's faster than a tornado!" cried the pig.

25
00:01:32.158 --> 00:01:34.093
[g@Wukong leaped at the woman.

26
00:01:34.094 --> 00:01:37.525
Suddenly he felt a stabbing pain.@g]

27
00:01:37.526 --> 00:01:41.500
"Ahh!" cried the monkey, grabbing his head.

28
00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:44.700
[g@"It hurts! It hurts!"

29
00:01:44.701 --> 00:01:47.284
He ran down the mountain.@g]

30
00:01:47.285 --> 00:01:51.808
Bajie and Wujing stared after Wukong in shock.

31
00:01:51.809 --> 00:01:55.853
The woman went back into her cave.

32
00:01:55.854 --> 00:01:59.011
"What happened to Wukong?" asked the pig.

33
00:01:59.012 --> 00:02:02.738
"Nothing hurts him except for the Tight Headband spell."

34
00:02:02.739 --> 00:02:08.450
"I don't know," said Wujing, scratching his head.

35
00:02:08.451 --> 00:02:13.523
They went down the mountain and found the monkey crouching by a stream.

36
00:02:13.524 --> 00:02:15.920
He was still holding his head.

37
00:02:15.921 --> 00:02:18.958
"Are you all right?" asked Wujing.

38
00:02:18.959 --> 00:02:23.300
[g@"That woman stabbed me in the head," moaned Wukong.

39
00:02:23.301 --> 00:02:29.341
"The pain is horrible!"@g]

40
00:02:29.342 --> 00:02:31.176
[g@Bajie snorted.

41
00:02:31.177 --> 00:02:34.336
"You're always bragging about how tough you are.@g]

42
00:02:34.337 --> 00:02:37.913
Now you're crying about getting stabbed in the head?"

43
00:02:37.914 --> 00:02:41.122
"It hurts!" shouted the monkey.

44
00:02:41.123 --> 00:02:42.982
[g@Wujing moved closer.

45
00:02:42.983 --> 00:02:45.017
"Let me see where she stabbed you."@g]

46
00:02:45.018 --> 00:02:47.067
[g@Wukong lowered his hands.

47
00:02:47.068 --> 00:02:49.674
There was no injury.@g]

48
00:02:49.675 --> 00:02:52.898
[g@Bajie laughed. "He's fine.

49
00:02:52.899 --> 00:02:55.968
He just wants us to feel bad for him."@g]

50
00:02:55.969 --> 00:02:58.079
[g@The monkey glared at the pig.

51
00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:02.823
"I'm telling you, it hurts!"@g]

52
00:03:02.824 --> 00:03:04.823
[g@He took a deep breath.

53
00:03:04.824 --> 00:03:08.226
"The pain is going away now though.@g]

54
00:03:08.227 --> 00:03:12.067
Let's go back up there and fight her again."

55
00:03:12.068 --> 00:03:16.732
The three companions returned to the cave.

56
00:03:16.733 --> 00:03:21.513
"Wukong, you stand back," said Bajie, laughing.

57
00:03:21.514 --> 00:03:25.873
"I don't want you getting hurt again."

58
00:03:25.874 --> 00:03:29.857
Wukong clenched his teeth.

59
00:03:29.858 --> 00:03:33.562
[g@The pig hit the door with his rake. [i@Smash!@i]

60
00:03:33.563 --> 00:03:35.886
The door exploded.@g]

61
00:03:35.887 --> 00:03:38.000
[g@The woman ran outside.

62
00:03:38.001 --> 00:03:41.389
"You smashed my door!" she shouted.@g]

63
00:03:41.390 --> 00:03:44.354
"Release our master!" shouted the pig.

64
00:03:44.355 --> 00:03:48.653
"Or we'll smash your entire mountain!"

65
00:03:48.654 --> 00:03:52.141
The woman spun around, faster and faster.

66
00:03:52.142 --> 00:03:56.046
Bajie and Wujing tried to strike her with their weapons.

67
00:03:56.047 --> 00:03:58.482
But the woman was too fast.

68
00:03:58.483 --> 00:04:04.079
Wukong raised his iron bar, waiting for a good moment to strike.

69
00:04:04.080 --> 00:04:08.194
Suddenly Bajie cried out, "Ahh!"

70
00:04:08.195 --> 00:04:13.333
He covered his nose and ran back down the mountain.

71
00:04:13.334 --> 00:04:16.435
The woman spun toward Wukong and Wujing.

72
00:04:16.436 --> 00:04:21.091
They turned and ran back down the mountain.

73
00:04:21.092 --> 00:04:26.261
Bajie was huddled on the ground, tears streaming from his eyes.

74
00:04:26.262 --> 00:04:32.139
"It hurts so badly!"

75
00:04:32.140 --> 00:04:34.180
Wukong laughed.

76
00:04:34.181 --> 00:04:37.879
[g@"Don't laugh at me!" cried Bajie.

77
00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:42.632
"She stabbed my nose!"@g]

78
00:04:42.633 --> 00:04:45.335
"You deserved it!" said the monkey.

79
00:04:45.336 --> 00:04:48.341
"You didn't believe me when I got hurt."

80
00:04:48.342 --> 00:04:51.514
[g@"Stop arguing," said Wujing.

81
00:04:51.515 --> 00:04:54.378
"We still have to save the Tang Monk."@g]

82
00:04:54.379 --> 00:04:58.560
"You're right," said Wukong. "Let's go back up there."

83
00:04:58.561 --> 00:05:01.958
[g@A voice called out, "Wait!"

84
00:05:01.959 --> 00:05:03.739
It was Guanyin.@g]

85
00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:07.304
The bodhisattva was walking toward the group.

86
00:05:07.305 --> 00:05:13.992
"Beware of that scorpion spirit!"

